📢 TCS CodeVita Registration – Important Instructions for dt/CT account 

Dear Students,

Students who wish to participate in TCS CodeVita are requested to complete their registration process at the earliest.

🔹 Step 1: Visit the official TCS NextStep portal and register as an IT candidate if you do not already have a TCS account.

🔹 Step 2: Complete all the required details carefully.

🔹 Step 3: After successful registration, your CT/DT ID will be generated. Please save this ID safely.

🔹 Step 4: Use the required details to proceed with TCS CodeVita registration through the official CodeVita portal.

🔹 Step 5: Complete email verification and all other registration steps.

⚠️ Important:
• Students who already have a valid CT/DT ID should not create a new ID.
• Enter your name, DOB, college and academic details correctly.
• Use an active email ID and mobile number.
• Save your CT/DT ID and registration confirmation for future reference.
• Complete the registration well before the deadline and do not wait until the last day.

🌐 TCS NextStep: https://nextstep.tcs.com/campus/
🌐 TCS CodeVita: https://codevita.tcsapps.com/

All eligible students are advised to make use of this opportunity and complete the registration without delay.

Training & Placement Cell
